# Marvin UI kit

When editing `web/src` UI, read `.cursor/skills/marvin-ui/SKILL.md` and import from `web/src/ui`.

Do not invent a new input, button, or card on the page. Add a missing control to the kit first.
Use Tailwind for layout only. Keep the existing Marvin colours. No Material / shadcn.
